        "summary": "Update User",
        "description": "Update user information\n\nThis endpoint updates user information. Only provided fields will be updated.\n\n**Permissions Required**: `users:update`\n\n**Parameters**:\n- `user_id`: Unique identifier of the user to update\n\n**Request Body**: All fields are optional\n- `username`: New username\n- `email`: New email address\n- `roles`: New list of roles\n- `permissions`: New list of permissions\n- `profile`: Updated profile information\n- `is_active`: Account active status\n- `is_verified`: Email verification status\n\n**Returns**: Updated user information",
        "operationId": "update_user_api_v1_users__user_id__put",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "user_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
